Record that `BlockAssembler` omits a chunk at `block_max_weight` exactly, while rejecting one weight unit over.

361bfb92f4 mining: include chunks at weight limit

The configured `block_max_weight` is inclusive, so accept a chunk whose accounted weight reaches it exactly.

18ff1d9262 test: characterize exact sigops rejection

Record that `BlockAssembler` omits a chunk at `MAX_BLOCK_SIGOPS_COST` exactly, while rejecting one cost unit over.

6eb5dfe342 mining: include chunks at sigops limit

Consensus permits the sigops cost limit exactly, so accept chunks that reach `MAX_BLOCK_SIGOPS_COST`.

8e7de8ef71 doc: clarify mining reservations
